[{"title":"广行路难 其一","author":"敖陶孙","text":"有声且勿吞，有泪且勿倾。\n声吞断人肠，泪倾草不生。\n万事有反覆，天地终无情。\n斲方以为轮，平地生九折。\n锻剑使绕指，青萍化为血。\n筋骸束未贯，光景电露灭。\n我欲竟此曲，此曲能颓山。\n奉君一卮酒，已矣当何言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54663,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中夜叹","author":"敖陶孙","text":"臞庵胸中空濩落，正尔有愁无处著。\n比来有酒三扪膺，突兀又似堆衡霍。\n道边俗子略满眼，举扇障尘不容却。\n正如白日杀快雠，草草九衢面皆恶。\n不应叔末尽鬼魅，世道如此我何乐。\n獐头鼠目动侮人，貌敬逡巡背轻薄。\n其馀边幅缀周孔，汝身无苦何遭缚。\n中原干戈六十载，八陵玉座尘漠漠。\n假君无力堪汛扫，渠可忘忧置恢拓。\n屯田边垒差易事，三十馀年束高阁。\n呜呼吾君至仁厚，一言罢行水赴壑。\n雷塘勺陂可复请，专创一司足经略。\n牛犁居屋旋填补，虎士编氓间参错。\n聊城指日下鲁奇，祁连刻期开卫幕。\n行之十年倘未效，臣头请膏斩马锷。\n奈何诸人忍奈事，天保正用初无作。\n居然判道君北海，不复追随我西洛。\n墨池到了须楯鼻，茶瓯小缓支铛脚。\n儒生寂寞守太玄，共尽同归一丘壑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54664,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长歌行","author":"敖陶孙","text":"徐州文壤基崇坛，老蔡径尺刳心肝。\n铜槃照夜血光碧，上有惨澹双镆干。\n请君载书许君死，彻器未竟盟已寒。\n了知今人不如古，古人亦有难知处。\n张生刎颈歼陈馀，郦儿给印屠诸吕。\n劝君结交勿结心，报君多是逡巡人。\n救饥重脱嗾獒厄，出淖曾叨食马恩。\n轻言托心腹，心腹为祸媒。\n畏途巉空薄侧掌，要离孤冢空崔嵬。\n我愿中堂置瓮常盛酒，后列丝竹前宾友。\n细腰灯前拓秋窗，有来白事酹其口。\n交亦不必结，名亦不必闻。\n燕南氍毹藉地醉，千载一笑平原君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54665,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思古人","author":"敖陶孙","text":"思古人，思古人，古人皦皦若日月。\n我欲剖棺斲出古人心，惟见苍苔漫白骨。\n请陈古人心，君勿骇客言。\n古人惟一真，可使风俗皆还淳。\n杀鸡不及林宗，炊黍不候庞公。\n雪中安道兴适尽，坐上公荣樽已空。\n呼酒径劝君，欲眠即遣客。\n嵇康巨源不为绝，戴崇彭宣本相得。\n徐庶失老母，密如玄德不能夺之臣。\n严陵薄宦情，狎如文叔不能止之客。\n包胥伍员不失其为友，羊祜陆抗不害其为敌。\n我有蒸壶，安事隐语。\n我但食韭，安用多种。\n割肉元知方朔真，拿金岂即刘叉勇。\n古人心事有如此，何至颜色相媚奉。\n道衰舛仁义，世乱生奸雄。\n君知臧否不挂口，正虑匕首揕其胸。\n我生恐无用，我死知无闻。\n作书预与儿辈诀，葬时定觅要离坟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54666,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"捣衣吟","author":"敖陶孙","text":"北邻捣衣声，明当葭管动。\n随宜过街巷，一岁三日用。\n请君歇砧杵，指直霜气重。\n君不见南邻已试明年灯，应制春衫泥小凤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54667,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠缙云陈志仲主簿楚语一篇","author":"敖陶孙","text":"若有人兮江之皋，搴珠树兮纫落毛。\n既轻举以远睐，众流靡靡兮汩独与吾相遭。\n余惧夫人之仙幻兮，指逵术以要之。\n忽改容而善步兮，纷还折之得宜。\n斥姬满之荒淫兮，服尧禹之所趋。\n载神鼎以自随兮，出夔魍以惊愚。\n予虑夫参重以贾踣兮，曰此耿耿之故也。\n闵一世之滔滔兮，谓彼不吾即而吾亦为此惧也。\n岁贸贸其婉晚兮，天浩浩其雨霜。\n反而顾余兮，被发内狂。\n前九疑之丧道兮，后渭浐之无梁。\n微夫子之亢衡兮，几人鬼之披攘。\n望兔迹之咫尺兮，仡驰骛之坚彊。\n车轧轧其相摩，肩促促其相望。\n欲抽心而改错兮，虑夫子之我惩。\n忽风后其降予兮，天老字予以嘉名。\n独怦怦其不自得兮，泪流轼之纵横。\n幸哀其中道之离立兮，若示之以正通。\n纵世人之不吾与兮，吾将卒以自明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54668,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赓韵题精舍","author":"晁子东","text":"数椽茅屋俯清溪，学者盈门所得栖。\n地僻任从云聚散，林深不碍日东西。\n巍巍道德千年在，凛凛声猷万古齐。\n遗像载瞻三太息，一庭烟草有馀凄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54669,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绿头鸭 其二 咏月","author":"晁元礼","text":"晚云收，淡天一片琉璃。\n烂银盘、来从海底，皓色千里澄辉。\n莹无尘、素娥淡伫，静可数、丹桂参差。\n玉露初零，金风未凛，一年无似此佳时。\n露坐久、疏萤时度，乌鹊正南飞。\n瑶台冷，阑干凭暖，欲下迟迟。\n念佳人、音尘别后，对此应解相思。\n最关情、漏声正永，暗断肠、花影偷移。\n料得来宵，清光未减，阴晴天气又争知。\n共凝恋、如今别后，还是隔年期。\n人强健，清尊素影，长愿相随。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54670,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题慈云院双松亭","author":"晁公为","text":"云閒龙躩千寻干，地底雷奔万仞泉。\n寄语庐山旧游客，个中端不减栖贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54671,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘阮洞","author":"晁公为","text":"桃花开已繁，溪水溅溅去。\n不见持杯人，自叹来何暮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54672,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"峡山寺","author":"晁公迈","text":"地辟天分碧峡嵬，雷奔电激驾潮回。\n神移古殿名犹在，石架禅房势欲摧。\n璧月近依朱槛转，冰泉暗度白云来。\n南游瘴国吾何恨，怀抱多从此地开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54673,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗扇","author":"晁公武","text":"短篷烟里冷萧萧，两岸梅花各见招。\n吹散前村一杯酒，满江风雨不相饶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54674,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日","author":"晁公武","text":"蜗牛庐畔舫斋前，春晚风光绝可怜。\n云补断山尤秀拔，竹藏残蕊尚婵娟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54675,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荆州即事 其二","author":"晁公武","text":"初上蓬笼竹笮船，始知身是剑南官。\n沙头沽酒市楼暖，靳步买薪江墅寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54676,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荆州即事 其一","author":"晁公武","text":"战船不见和州载，胜地惟馀避暑宫。\n今日刍荛皆得往，大王风作庶人风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54677,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏日过庄严寺僧索诗为留三绝 其一","author":"晁公武","text":"松筠窈窕隐禅房，茗碗熏炉白昼长。\n门外尘埃生熟恼，谁知林下自清凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54678,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏日过庄严寺僧索诗为留三绝 其二","author":"晁公武","text":"笑脱尘衫扑软红，杖藜徙倚水光中。\n最怜林叶深深处，遮尽斜阳不碍风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54679,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南定楼","author":"晁公武","text":"水接荆门陆控秦，卧龙陈迹久尤新。\n剑关驿外青山旧，锦里祠边碧草春。\n更筑飞楼瞰泸水，拟将遗恨问洪钧。\n南方已定虽饶富，北望中原正惨神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54680,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荷池","author":"晁公武","text":"平池积潦涨轻痕，宛若扁舟系水滨。\n断岸才盈六七尺，低蓬恰受两三人。\n巡檐悦目蒲莲秀，隐几忘机雁鹜驯。\n坐阅江湖好风景，不愁涛濑阔无津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54681,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登金山","author":"晁公武","text":"东游寻胜即登临，浮玉知名冠古今。\n万壑波涛喧海口，千年岩岫据江心。\n雨篷烟棹征帆远，晓磬昏钟佛屋深。\n诗客分留风景在，凭君一为发长吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54682,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酆都观","author":"晁公武","text":"胜绝平都观，盘纡石磴长。\n崇岗虎蹲踞，古柏雁分张。\n殿阁刚风外，轩墀灏气旁。\n烟华迎碧瓦，云叶覆雕墙。\n古有神仙术，能齐日月光。\n升腾继黄老，烜赫数阴王。\n采药岩峦秀，烧丹井灶香。\n綵云生洞穴，白昼上穹苍。\n陈迹今犹在，咸云实不亡。\n碑铭馀汉魏，像设自齐梁。\n仙骑霜毛洁，胎禽雪羽翔。\n豪商供香火，骚客斗篇章。\n顾我趋行殿，寻真到静坊。\n遗文观翠琰，隐诀悟青囊。\n傥解交龙虎，终能翳凤凰。\n定纡苍玉佩，径入白云乡。\n却忆求轻举，相传笑彼狂。\n李君炼丹石，韩子服硫黄。\n雅欲同南极，俄惊葬北邙。\n古今垂烱戒，服饵要周防。\n却老宁无策，怡神别有方。\n不须纨与素，但可举清觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54683,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏日过庄严寺僧索诗为留三绝 其三","author":"晁公武","text":"出门散策烟栖树，归路扶舆月蜕痕。\n十里江村入图画，野桥沙路杳难分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54684,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读林罕小说","author":"晁公武","text":"仓颉鹳鸟迹，于是创文字。\n原其制作心，本以便记事。\n呼读犹强名，况乃论位置。\n周人建小学，六书分义类。\n特令授童蒙，庶几别同异。\n奈何中古后，穿凿失伦次。\n虫皿晋医言，止戈楚人志。\n宋更?作騧，秦易罪为罪。\n三刀自梦徵，两日因谶记。\n山丝已怪妄，门草更茫昧。\n白水及绯衣，皆是表符瑞。\n解槐与说枣，抑又出讥戏。\n形声罕复论，一切归会义。\n咄哉许祭酒，著论穷巧慧。\n流俗喜不根，传授满当世。\n廷尉议三章，诸生谈六艺。\n往往授其言，大抵皆附会。\n林生最晚出，纷乱尤自恣。\n何言斯亭上，刻石高赑屃。\n却思荆舒祸，对此频雪涕。\n凭谁掩其恶，水火为焚弃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54685,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游焦山","author":"晁公武","text":"江势东倾剧建瓴，中流岩壑隐禅扃。\n游僧谁渡降龙钵，过客争摸瘗鹤铭。\n修竹捎云凌北固，桃花吹浪涨南溟。\n上人劝赋斯山境，乞与微吟勒翠屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54686,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天","author":"晁公武","text":"笑擘黄柑酒半醒。\n玉壶金斗夜生冰。\n开窗尽见千山雪，雪未消时月正明。\n兰烬短，麝煤轻。\n画楼钟鼓已三更。\n倚栏谁唱清真曲，人与梅花一样清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54687,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"晁公武","text":"铜梁山昏岚翠重，石镜水落滩声迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54688,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"晁公武","text":"轩窗竹院临流静，灯火瓜洲隔岸深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54689,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"晁公武","text":"只言天下少霖雨，不知隆中有卧龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54690,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"门外春寒数日风，登楼聊恃醉颜红。\n水浮渺莽春畦外，山在冥茫暮雨中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54691,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"只知流落倦飘蓬，岂识朝回合殿风。\n二月春容山色里，五更归梦雨声中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54692,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十二月八日雪","author":"晁公溯","text":"桃杏颜衰不解红，朝来飞雪舞回风。\n东风似与加湔拂，病叶枯枝一洗空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54693,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其十七 止庵","author":"晁公溯","text":"智者有所说，后生谁究明。\n韦编具此眼，时止复时行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54694,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其七 风穴","author":"晁公溯","text":"有风地鸣籁，无风石抱云。\n上人如宴坐，不可堕声闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54695,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其十 玉泉亭","author":"晁公溯","text":"徘徊立泉上，谁敢酌寒清。\n莫解金凿落，且听玉琮琤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54696,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其十八 西方阁","author":"晁公溯","text":"官失学四夷，寂寥洙泗滨。\n至此每再拜，西方有圣人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54697,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其十一 松风亭","author":"晁公溯","text":"皎皎石上月，飕飕松下风。\n清绝谁领会，倚杖送飞鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54698,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其二 罗汉洞","author":"晁公溯","text":"释迦行中国，设教周孔同。\n吾知诸子弟，不殊阙里中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54699,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其五 虎头峰","author":"晁公溯","text":"山灵亦自喜，尊者乃吾师。\n得与鹫岭并，不作虎头痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54700,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其三 唤鱼潭","author":"晁公溯","text":"潭水清见底，老僧来唤鱼。\n与渠同法食，持钵施斋馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54701,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其六 盘陀石","author":"晁公溯","text":"飞廉日扫除，预知尊者过。\n不令有尘垢，污此石盘陀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54702,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其十三 寒峰轩","author":"晁公溯","text":"崖阴日惨惨，石润露漙漙。\n何似蓝田下，高并玉山寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54703,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其一 慈姥岩","author":"晁公溯","text":"栖岩既下集，宾天复上征。\n八子似荀氏，中当有慈明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54704,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其十四 碧筠亭","author":"晁公溯","text":"萧然一丛竹，何当举似人。\n不可妄认此，青青为法身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54705,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其十六 壁轩","author":"晁公溯","text":"卷书置案上，默坐初不看。\n侍者空堵立，湛然惟壁观。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54706,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中岩十八咏 其八 瀑布泉","author":"晁公溯","text":"溅沫响空谷，分流清法筵。\n元因卓锡地，今为洗钵泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54707,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午睡","author":"晁公溯","text":"渐觉铜壶刻漏迟，捲帘花日弄晴辉。\n午窗睡美无人唤，梦逐游丝自在飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54708,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木枥观","author":"晁公溯","text":"离离荒草满遗宫，羽化无人殿阁空。\n白鹤亦应天上去，独馀枯枥起秋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54709,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木犀花二首 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"满贮彫盘可镇帷，论花压尽剑东西。\n岂惟鼻观遭渠恼，邻舍闻香亦骇鸡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54710,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木犀花二首 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"粟玉开花颜色新，秋光未觉减阳春。\n萧然不受风埃涴，知是高标可辟尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54711,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宇文绍恭所藏其父德闻手书其祖家训一卷","author":"晁公溯","text":"蜀士相与语，故家谁得如。\n千年令威宅，一纸伏波书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f7